ue":166},"このデータセットには、ISS「きぼう」の加圧モジュール（PM）で行われた氷結晶（Ice）実験のデータが含まれています。",{"@value":168,"@language":12,"encodingFormat":169},"This dataset contains data from Ice Crystal (Ice) experiment on ISS-Kibo's Pressurized Module (PM).\n\n\u003Cstyle>\n  table th {\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n\u003C\u002Fstyle>\n\u003Ctable>\n  \u003Ctbody>\n    \u003Ctr>\n      \u003Cth>title\u003C\u002Fth>\n      \u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"http:\u002F\u002Fiss.jaxa.jp\u002Fen\u002Fkiboexp\u002Ftheme\u002Ffirst\u002Fice_crystal\u002F\"  target=\"_blank\">Pattern Formation during Ice Crystal Growth\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Ftd>\n    \u003C\u002Ftr>\n    \u003Ctr>\n      \u003Cth>category\u003C\u002Fth>\n      \u003Ctd>Crystal Growth\u003C\u002Ftd>\n    \u003C\u002Ftr>\n    \u003Ctr>\n      \u003Cth>type\u003C\u002Fth>\n      \u003Ctd>ISS Experiment\u003C\u002Ftd>\n    \u003C\u002Ftr>\n    \u003Ctr>\n      \u003Cth>facility\u003C\u002Fth>\n      \u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"http:\u002F\u002Fiss.jaxa.jp\u002Fen\u002Fkiboexp\u002Fpm\u002Fscof\u002F\" target=\"_blank\">Solution Crystallization Observation Facility\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Ftd>\n    \u003C\u002Ftr>\n    \u003Ctr>\n      \u003Cth>cell\u003C\u002Fth>\n      \u003Ctd>Ice Crystal Cell\u003C\u002Ftd>\n    \u003C\u002Ftr>\n    \u003Ctr>\n      \u003Cth>start date (GMT)\u003C\u002Fth>\n      \u003Ctd>2008-12-01 (336)\u003C\u002Ftd>\n    \u003C\u002Ftr>\n    \u003Ctr>\n      \u003Cth>end date (GMT)\u003C\u002Fth>\n      \u003Ctd>2009-02-18 (49)\u003C\u002Ftd>\n    \u003C\u002Ftr>\n    \u003Ctr>\n      \u003Cth>note\u003C\u002Fth>\n      \u003Ctd>\u003C\u002Ftd>\n    \u003C\u002Ftr>\n  \u003C\u002Ftbody>\n\u003C\u002Ftable>\n\n### Detailed Documentation\n\n- [Experiment parameter list of Ice Crystal](https:\u002F\u002Fdata.darts.isas.jaxa.jp\u002Fpub\u002Fkibo\u002Fice\u002Fdocuments\u002Fice_parameter.pdf) (PDF 176KB)\n- [Typical temperature profile of Ice Crystal Experiment](https:\u002F\u002Fdata.darts.isas.jaxa.jp\u002Fpub\u002Fkibo\u002Fice\u002Fdocuments\u002Fice_experiment_sequence.pdf) (PDF 17KB)\n- [Telemetry list of Ice Crystal Experiment](https:\u002F\u002Fdata.darts.isas.jaxa.jp\u002Fpub\u002Fkibo\u002Fice\u002Fdocuments\u002Fice_telemetry_list.pdf) (PDF 67KB)\n- [Chart of AOS\u002FLOS of satellite communications](https:\u002F\u002Fdata.darts.isas.jaxa.jp\u002Fpub\u002Fkibo\u002Fice\u002Fdocuments\u002Faos_los.pdf) (PDF 16KB)\n- [Drawing, Crystallization Cell and Nucleation Cell of Ice Crystal Cell](https:\u002F\u002Fdata.darts.isas.jaxa.jp\u002Fpub\u002Fkibo\u002Fice\u002Fdocuments\u002Fice_cell_diagram.pdf) (PDF 499KB)\n- [Schema, optical path of Ice Crystal Cell observation system](https:\u002F\u002Fdata.darts.isas.jaxa.jp\u002Fpub\u002Fkibo\u002Fice\u002Fdocuments\u002Fice_cell_observation_schema.pdf) (PDF 140KB)\n","text\u002Fmarkdown",{"ja":171,"en":172},"graph LR\n classDef this fill:#ffa23e\n  darts:kibo-pm-crystal-ice[\"ISS「きぼう」与圧モジュール内実験 - Ice Crystal (Ice)\"]:::this\nclick darts:kibo-pm-crystal-ice href \"\u002Fdatasets\u002Fdarts:kibo-pm-crystal-ice\"\n","graph LR\n classDef this fill:#ffa23e\n  darts:kibo-pm-crystal-ice[\"ISS Kibo PM Experiment - Ice Crystal (Ice)\"]:::this\nclick darts:kibo-pm-crystal-ice href \"\u002Fdatasets\u002Fdarts:kibo-pm-crystal-ice\"\n",1794274210111]